<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57728" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλαῦμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλαίω</span>) always in
		pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weeping, wailing</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				705
			</span></i> (troch.), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.2.14
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλαυμάτων πηγαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					887
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλαυμάτων ἄξια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					4.39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>troubles, misfortunes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				249
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλαύμαθ᾽ ὑπάρξει τινί,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλαύσεται</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				932
			</span></i> (anap.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
